{"id":66670,"date":"2025-09-27T18:20:22","date_gmt":"2025-09-27T17:20:22","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=66670"},"modified":"2026-10-01T22:48:31","modified_gmt":"2026-10-01T21:48:31","slug":"2-leguas-da-eurocidade","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/2-leguas-da-eurocidade\/","title":{"rendered":"2 L\u00e9guas da Eurocidade 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">2 L\u00e9guas da Eurocidade 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">As <strong>2 L\u00e9guas da Eurocidade 2026<\/strong> realizam-se no dia <strong>25 de Outubro de 2026<\/strong>, com partidas concentradas na <strong>Avenida da Juventude<\/strong>, em <strong>Valen\u00e7a<\/strong>. Esta emblem\u00e1tica prova transfronteiri\u00e7a de atletismo em estrada une Portugal e Espanha num percurso essencialmente plano e r\u00e1pido, atravessando a hist\u00f3rica <strong>Ponte Internacional<\/strong> sobre o Rio Minho entre Valen\u00e7a e Tui, antes do regresso \u00e0 meta em territ\u00f3rio nacional.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva Verdoejense<\/strong> com o apoio do <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Valen\u00e7a<\/strong>, o evento oferece um programa desportivo completo para toda a fam\u00edlia: a corrida principal de <strong>10 km (2 L\u00e9guas)<\/strong> cronometrada por chip e com pr\u00e9mios por escal\u00f5es, uma <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> de baixa dificuldade, e duas dist\u00e2ncias jovens gratuitas (a <strong>Mini-L\u00e9gua de 1,5 km<\/strong> e a <strong>L\u00e9guazinha de 500 metros<\/strong>). Garante o teu dorsal e vem viver o atletismo sem fronteiras no Alto Minho.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">25 de Outubro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snaps