ace-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Jovem<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Mini-L\u00e9gua (12 aos 17 anos)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 25 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:30<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Obrigat\u00f3ria:<\/strong> 0.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 22\/10)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">L\u00e9guazinha (7 aos 11 anos)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 25 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:35<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Obrigat\u00f3ria:<\/strong> 0.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 22\/10)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realizam as 2 L\u00e9guas da Eurocidade 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se no domingo, 25 de Outubro de 2026, com partidas e chegadas na Avenida da Juventude, em Valen\u00e7a, no distrito de Viana do Castelo.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e os hor\u00e1rios de partida?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A Mini-L\u00e9gua (1,5 km) parte \u00e0s 09:30, a L\u00e9guazinha (500m) \u00e0s 09:35, a Caminhada de 5 km \u00e0s 10:00 e a prova principal de 10 km (2 L\u00e9guas) \u00e0s 10:15.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O percurso atravessa a Ponte Internacional at\u00e9 Espanha?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, a prova principal de 10 km \u00e9 transfronteiri\u00e7a e atravessa a hist\u00f3rica Ponte Internacional entre Valen\u00e7a (Portugal) e Tui (Galiza, Espanha), com barreira hor\u00e1ria de tr\u00e2nsito condicionado na ponte fixada \u00e0s 11:15 no regresso a Valen\u00e7a.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os valores de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e prazos?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Na corrida de 10 km, a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o tem um custo de 7 \u20ac at\u00e9 20 de Setembro, 10 \u20ac at\u00e9 18 de Outubro e 13 \u20ac at\u00e9 22 de Outubro. As dist\u00e2ncias da Caminhada (5 km), Mini-L\u00e9gua (1,5 km) e L\u00e9guazinha (500m) s\u00e3o de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o gratuita, mas de registo obrigat\u00f3rio.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando podem ser levantados os dorsais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os dorsais podem ser levantados no Pavilh\u00e3o Municipal de Valen\u00e7a no s\u00e1bado, 24 de Outubro, entre as 15:00 e as 18:00, ou no pr\u00f3prio dia da prova (25 de Outubro) at\u00e9 \u00e0s 10:00.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"2 L\u00e9guas da Eurocidade 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-25\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Valen\u00e7a, Viana do Castelo\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Valen\u00e7a\", \"addressRegion\": \"Viana do Castelo\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realizam as 2 L\u00e9guas da Eurocidade 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se no domingo, 25 de Outubro de 2026, com partidas e chegadas na Avenida da Juventude, em Valen\u00e7a, no distrito de Viana do Castelo.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e os hor\u00e1rios de partida?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A Mini-L\u00e9gua (1,5 km) parte \u00e0s 09:30, a L\u00e9guazinha (500m) \u00e0s 09:35, a Caminhada de 5 km \u00e0s 10:00 e a prova principal de 10 km (2 L\u00e9guas) \u00e0s 10:15.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O percurso atravessa a Ponte Internacional at\u00e9 Espanha?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, a prova principal de 10 km \u00e9 transfronteiri\u00e7a e atravessa a hist\u00f3rica Ponte Internacional entre Valen\u00e7a (Portugal) e Tui (Galiza, Espanha), com barreira hor\u00e1ria de tr\u00e2nsito condicionado na ponte fixada \u00e0s 11:15 no regresso a Valen\u00e7a.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os valores de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e prazos?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Na corrida de 10 km, a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o tem um custo de 7 \u20ac at\u00e9 20 de Setembro, 10 \u20ac at\u00e9 18 de Outubro e 13 \u20ac at\u00e9 22 de Outubro. As dist\u00e2ncias da Caminhada (5 km), Mini-L\u00e9gua (1,5 km) e L\u00e9guazinha (500m) s\u00e3o de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o gratuita, mas de registo obrigat\u00f3rio.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde e quando podem ser levantados os dorsais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Os dorsais podem ser levantados no Pavilh\u00e3o Municipal de Valen\u00e7a no s\u00e1bado, 24 de Outubro, entre as 15:00 e as 18:00, ou no pr\u00f3prio dia da prova (25 de Outubro) at\u00e9 \u00e0s 10:00.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":68626,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,27,28,624],"event_type_2":[726,820,62],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-66670","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-valenca-viana-do-castelo","event_type-caminhada","event_type-corrida","event_type-corrida-10-km","event_type-kids","event_type_2-porto-e-norte","event_type_2-portugal","event_type_2-viana-do-castelo"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/cartaz-2-leguas-da-eurocidade-1-671x1024.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/66670","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"h